  "score_support_basis": "The SCRS rationale concludes the comment deserves a score of 5, but this is incorrect. The comment does not clarify what '5 and 6' refer to, so paper authors cannot confidently determine which part of the paper is being addressed, which aligns with the gold score of 3, not 5.",
